description "Agent Alexsandr Kallus

Aggressive ISB Hybrid with high mobility and flexibility.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Cripples/Tracking On Hit
- RK-3 Blaster Pistol (3)
-- Mag Reload
- Kallus's Bo-Rifle (2)
-- Based on the M5
-- 25% Increased Velocity
-- 70% Slower ROF
-- 15% More Damage/FP Drain
- Bo-Electro Staff 
-- Staff Style Saber 
-- Low Damage (80)
-- 3 Chain Limit
-- Applies Pulse/Tracking/Disarm/Stun on Hit
-- Saber Defense (1) 
- Frag Grenades (2)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (2) 
- Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Healing (2)
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- 15% Faster Skill Cooldowns
- 25% Faster Hacking Speed

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4 Weapon Out]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS3]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS4 Melee]"